cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Hera in published work, please cite it as below."
title: "Hera: capture planning and SfM preprocessing for 360 degree reality capture"
abstract: >-
  Hera is a single-file, dependency-free Python application for planning and
  processing 360 degree interior capture. It includes KapturPlan, an
  interactive capture planner that derives fiducial spacing from AprilTag
  detection limits; a tag36h11 fiducial sheet generator; equirectangular to
  cubemap extraction with per-camera orientation; operator and rig mask
  projection; blur-based frame rejection; and exact COLMAP pinhole intrinsics
  export.
type: software
